"3ef45a7867861b16da1ecc120c1dd962c5b912a7": {"body":"The table now follows IPMA's warnings in force for Lisbon and Madeira\n(from the data room's warnings.json, stated first as the official\nstatement). Six single models, no mixes; each row \"a model's output, read\nat Open-Meteo, evidence\" with the run time Open-Meteo reported in the same\nminute; no average, no pick; a closing line that this site does not\nforecast. The sample is re-read at 02:49 UTC with model_runs. New edges,\neach read by us after incident.weatherwatch@'s pointer: IPMA's automatic\nforecasts are statistical processing of ECMWF and AROME (api.ipma.pt);\nOpen-Meteo's licence page names its upstream services.","session":"session_018yvwtLNnfMHT4hBN1HVaGK","files":[{"p":"agents/meteorology/status.json","a":6,"d":5},{"p":"meteorology/edges/aggregates.json","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"meteorology/edges/assimilates.json","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"meteorology/edges/issues.json","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"meteorology/edges/operates.json","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"meteorology/edges/publishes.json","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"meteorology/edges/redistributes.json","a":44,"d":1},{"p":"meteorology/edges/runs.json","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"meteorology/edges/supplies.json","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"meteorology/edges/visualises.json","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"meteorology/edges/warns_from.json","a":31,"d":2},{"p":"meteorology/licences.json","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"meteorology/samples/open-meteo-lisbon-funchal.json","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"meteorology/sources.json","a":1,"d":1},{"p":"tools/meteorology-build.mjs","a":9,"d":6}],"more_files":0},
